DESCRIPTION:Mason James brings a quick\, self-deprecating humor that might 
 just keep you laughing all night—fingers crossed! In just two years of do
 ing comedy\, he recently won the 2023 Funniest Person in Houston Competitio
 n. Since then\, he’s been lucky enough to gain 40\,000 followers on socia
 l media and rack up 20 million views on his videos. He’s also grateful to
  be a paid regular at the Comedy Mothership in Austin\, Texas. It’s been 
 quite the ride\, and he’s excited to see where it leads next!\n\nManageme
 nt reserves the right to prevent customers from entering the facility who t
 hey deem disruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://come
 dyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/room-861-at-goodnights-mason-james/
